sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Caller
    participant X as XStructuredRunnable
    participant R as Wrapped Runnable
    participant F as Repair Runnable

    App->>X: invoke(input)
    X->>X: add instructions
    X->>R: invoke(prepared input)
    R-->>X: message or text
    X->>X: extract and validate
    opt invalid, and repair is configured
        loop at most max_attempts
            X->>F: response + problems
            F-->>X: corrected response
            X->>X: validate again
        end
    end
    X-->>App: XStructuredResult
    Note over App,F: One traced run, with the wrapped and repair<br/>Runnables as its child runs.